[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600797761","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101752#issuecomment-2600797761","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101752","id":2600797761,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bBQZB","user":{"login":"monxa","id":84077629,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDc3NjI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84077629?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monxa","html_url":"https://github.com/monxa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monxa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monxa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monxa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monxa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monxa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monxa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monxa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monxa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monxa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-19T10:22:12Z","updated_at":"2025-01-19T10:35:19Z","body":"Since this approach leverages the compile-object-private `resource_loader.cpp::_validate_local_path`, it seems like the most minimal change possible. I also appreciate the improved separation of concerns introduced here.\r\n\r\nThat said, my opinion might not fully align with the vision of the experts in core/bindings.\r\n\r\nVerified and tested, including the case for local paths.\r\n\r\nEdit: Regarding local paths, their behavior here differs from load/preload, where a relative path to the calling script can be provided. This change preserves the existing behavior with local paths.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600797761/r